Use `set` operations on keys for efficiency with larger lists.

Dictionary .keys() returns a dict_keys view object that's set-like, enabling direct set operations on keys without converting to set() first.

How It Works
The dict_keys object implements Python's Set abstract base class, so operators like |, &, -, and ^ work efficiently on live dictionary views.
​

Union (|): All unique keys from both. internal_dict.keys() | external_dict.keys() → {'t1', 't2', 't3', 't4'}
​

Intersection (&): Common keys. internal_dict.keys() & external_dict.keys() → {'t1', 't2'}
​

Difference (-): Keys in left but not right (e.g., missing). internal_dict.keys() - external_dict.keys() → {'t3'}
​

Symmetric difference (^): Keys in exactly one dict. → {'t3', 't4'}
---------------------------------​

internal_dict = dict([("t1", 100), ("t2", 200), ("t3", 300)])
external_dict = dict([("t1", 100), ("t2", 250), ("t4", 400)])

print(internal_dict.keys() - external_dict.keys())  # {'t3'} (missing)
print(set(internal_dict) & set(external_dict))     # {'t1', 't2'} (same as views)
--------------------
Use FULL OUTER JOIN on the key column to identify missing items and value changes between the two lists modeled as tables.
​
SQL Solution:
WITH internal_data AS (
  SELECT 't1' AS key_col, 100 AS value_col UNION ALL
  SELECT 't2', 200 UNION ALL
  SELECT 't3', 300
),
external_data AS (
  SELECT 't1' AS key_col, 100 AS value_col UNION ALL
  SELECT 't2', 250 UNION ALL
  SELECT 't4', 400
)
SELECT 
  COALESCE(i.key_col, e.key_col) AS key_col,
  i.value_col AS internal_value,
  e.value_col AS external_value,
  CASE 
    WHEN i.key_col IS NULL THEN 'Added in external'
    WHEN e.key_col IS NULL THEN 'Missing in external'
    WHEN i.value_col != e.value_col THEN 'Value changed'
    ELSE 'Match'
  END AS status
FROM internal_data i
FULL OUTER JOIN external_data e ON i.key_col = e.key_col;
-----------------------------------------------
| key_col | internal_value | external_value | status              |
| ------- | -------------- | -------------- | ------------------- |
| t1      | 100            | 100            | Match               |
| t2      | 200            | 250            | Value changed       |
| t3      | 300            | NULL           | Missing in external |
| t4      | NULL           | 400            | Added in external   |
